===Noun===
{{en-noun|horseflies}}

# Any of several medium- to large [[flies]], of the [[family]] [[Tabanidae]], that suck the [[blood]] of [[mammal]]s (not to be confused with Stomoxys calcitrans, the [[stable fly]], or [[Wikipedia:stable fly|dog fly]]).

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|fly of family Tabanidae}} {{l|en|cleg}} {{qualifier|dialectal}}, [[breezefly]], [[gadfly]]

====Hyponyms====
* {{sense|individual species or subgroups of the family Tabanidae}} {{l|en|deer fly}}, {{l|en|Wikipedia:Deer fly|yellow fly}}, {{l|en|March fly}} {{qualifier|Australia}}, [[zimb]]

